          "_name": "features5",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"features4\" group=\"Features\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showsubTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Card Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#fafafa\" condition=\"showLink\" selected>\n\n        <select title=\"Cards\" name=\"cardsAmount\">\n            <option value=\"1\">1</option>\n            <option value=\"2\" selected>2</option>\n        </select>\n\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/dec2e4s-8666e310-ad5b-4698-8d41-ca31432fdb8f-1136x640.jpeg\" parallax selected>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.7\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\">\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">Cración de identidad visual</h6>\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                    <b>Creamos marcas únicas</b></h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Tu imagen debe ser única y no sacada de un banco de imágenes que cualquiera puede tener.<br>El logo es la primera imagen que tienen los clientes de ti.<br>¡Muéstrate al mundo como alguien profesional!</p>\n                                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"portafolio.html\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Ver más</a></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/web-portafolio-asset-357x357.png\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-6\" mbr-if=\"cardsAmount > 1\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"row\">\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-7\">\n                            <div class=\"text-wrapper\">\n                                <h6 class=\"card-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-2\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showsubTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-subtitle\">\n                                    Talonarios</h6>\n                                <h5 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                                    <b>Talonarios 100% personalizados</b></h5>\n                                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .mbr-section-btn\">Qué es la Papelería corporativa funcional?. Es aquella que te ayuda no solo a mantener en contacto con tus clientes, sino que también cumple funciones de organización y gestión interna dentro de tu negocio.</p>\n                                <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a href=\"talonarios.html\" class=\"btn btn-warning\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Quiero un talonario</a></div>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"col-12 col-md-5\">\n                            <div class=\"img-wrapper\">\n                                <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/8d661f58-e736-4073-8b57-7fa6578c62b2-357x357.jpg\" alt=\"Mobirise\">\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
